      "description": "Executes OpenAI Chat Completion API calls with support for both OpenAI and Azure OpenAI endpoints. Handles conversation history, tool/function calling, automatic retries, and response formatting. Returns structured outputs including message content, tool calls, and updated conversation history.",
      "display_name": "OpenAI Chat Completion",
      "runtime_user": {
